        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Thanks for the quick reply! I'd expect it to highlight all different cells. Computationally that's trivial. For shifted attribute codes we could figure out with which observed codes reference codes overlap the most and then remap the observed codes before comparing.\n\nFor the side-by-side view we could just split by newlines and then join them.",
